><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Destroy the enemies, try to find coins and buy new weapons and first-aid kits on The Merchant.<br></li><li> 6 different enemies. Each with it's difficulty and environment.<br></li><li> 6 different weapons. Each one with it's own playstyle.<br></li><li> 90s inspired graphics.<br></li><li> Countless randomly generated levels in 6 different areas/themes. Each with different elements.<br></li><li> Game always updated with free content and improvements for life!</li></ul><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1180110/extras/7b5c07635adb9f6a74a351d7dc737c59.poster.avif?t=1726326571\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1180110/extras/7b5c07635adb9f6a74a351d7dc737c59.webm?t=1726326571\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1180110/extras/7b5c07635adb9f6a74a351d7dc737c59.mp4?t=1726326571\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div>",
